description: Enforce that 'use baz/bar' is legal only when baz explicitly declares
  reexport of bar; any reach-in without consent is a hard error. Done when reexport
  declarations are parsed/recognized, consented reexports resolve, and reach-in attempts
  produce hard errors verified by tests. Depends on path-scoped use resolution subtask.
